至不知道它是否能双向通行。\n这座传送门似乎通往马基·埃亚尔最后的希望城附近。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ae9cf7810f15fabb0803c63585a547d57efea855c0fd123a4d953cb27fd6cef1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f64fbf8d74b866c776c59f9f2787e3b0a9e3cc1467f09f54937a965b987982f6","logical_entry_identity":"f372af5273333c569ced2382107e8cc67fb02524cc191207ca77e5bc062980c1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ANTIQUE_WHITE#You notice a hole that could fit the gem key you found earlier, inserting it reveals the passage to the next level.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#ANTIQUE_WHITE#你注意到有一个小孔和你之前找到的宝石钥匙形状很相似，你插入了钥匙，出现了通往下一层的入口。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"40f270e47791d51d093e1fa12fda88b0b419559d8815b259a6f3c15576421a34","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f65075af7b048b979dc92be53a76bcf94b6d6a63dc1be07f9f8ee2e8211a3333","logical_entry_identity":"ce6b36177affbac602654b2b10fbefb528cbe809cb39cf9d6752c8cc0c3bbe22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Well then please do something about this evil magic!","source_tag":"_t","target":"那就请一定要想办法对付这邪恶的魔法！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa5a3d085ae0d2053d453c6a0c5a974f3f933cc0ae138b6c55806cad9559ead9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f657808ae684f2824b3cc8cd3ed057511983f29c288e05fb79c77801a01fa0c2","logical_entry_identity":"21a53f043ba914280103ce8414d18a5cfa105fb53b3d9516f37278c779e5c37d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Skullcracker","source_tag":"talent name","target":"铁头功"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9f2fdea4c7d423c5e58351fe4a93f89f1e4a248c7e7549c795793801400b25b8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f65bb3b5be53f525f09c17258c7d5c3bf70688532c28340fb4ce7ccd400559da","logical_entry_identity":"17690470d49a76b2d12561fd28bf2021918754f5f4efd8a691233fe5349d4562","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Since the dawn of time mages have experimented with the elements.\nWhile most mages are content using the Fire school, a few of them took their research deeper and created Wildfire magic.\nAt its core lies the Wildfire, a fire so hot it can even damage creatures normally immune.\n\nYou have mastered Wildfire magic and can now create new Archmage characters that can learn the #LIGHT_GREEN#Wildfire talents#WHITE#.\n\nTalents:\n- #YELLOW#Blastwave: #WHITE#Unleash a fire nova around you, damaging and knocking back anything caught inside\n- #YELLOW#Dancing Fires: #WHITE#Project your inner fire to all creatures in your line of sight, setting them ablaze\n- #YELLOW#Combust: #WHITE#Disrupt normal burning effects and make them combust at once\n- #YELLOW#Wildfire: #WHITE#Master the Wildfire and pierce even through fire immunities\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"自始以来法师们进行着各种元素试验。\n大多数法师满足于使用火系魔法，有些人则进行深入的研究并创造出了焱系魔法。\n其核心是“野火燎原”，这种火焰炽热无比，甚至可以伤害通常免疫火焰的生物。\n\n你掌握了焱系魔法，现在你可以创建一个新的可以学习 #LIGHT_GREEN#焱系技能#WHITE# 的元素法师角色。\n\n技能：\n- #YELLOW# 火焰新星：#WHITE# 对你的四周施放一个火焰新星，造成伤害并击退周围目标。\n- #YELLOW# 火焰之舞：#WHITE# 点燃你视线中的所有目标。\n- #YELLOW# 灼烧：#WHITE# 打断常规的燃烧效果，使其立即爆燃\n- #YELLOW# 野火燎原：#WHITE# 你对焱系魔法的掌握使你可以对火焰免疫的生物造成伤害。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd847cb70c45ccd2cb471bbac8ae185ed0afea5edea103bc5418047322b68446","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f65f8b0136e2d6d4dd17cb9824489aa45a64c2a295b23752744c54ba0a9c015c","logical_entry_identity":"f6a0fc91555b95055421b50c5bc8971b6a79a1fdd9b9da293a0c77f5b06995b7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"reduces mental save penalty","source_tag":"_t","target":"降低精神豁免惩罚"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"666b4f2b207feee2921785293bc855a53572d2bb68a62f7b1d0fe2f5b2a5b9f6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f666e3e810e3de17db7cca4b9878ddcd77283bb56328c459124e550ed513c9a5","logical_entry_identity":"14a3c50b347acbf458d7308c2bfac3e3ae7237ca8087d4e2528c208761af96de","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This ogre closes in fast on you, arms open for the hug of death.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个食人魔快速地接近你，张开他死亡的拥抱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8b14d8c34ac4e71f82936d94ac4a97e73071a070fedcb40